    "closure": "Both prepared facts captured inside acquired-resource cleanup try after final check and before published, without extra owner entry/await. Final prepared return after completion/cache initialization. Wrapper fixed primary retained across one cleanup attempt/aggregate. Legacy shapes/cache remain distinct.",
    "id": "F3",
    "paths": [
      "packages/server/src/development-runtime.ts",
      "packages/server/src/transaction-runtime.ts",
